cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ImgTools, please cite it as below. It was co-created with generative AI; see the README's 'Credits and AI disclosure'."
type: software
title: "ImgTools: clown, depth, shadow and ambient occlusion passes for Rhino"
version: 1.0.0-beta
date-released: 2026-11-26
authors:
  - alias: adpchrgruber
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/adpchrgruber/ImgTools_Rh8"
abstract: >-
  Rhino 8/9 plug-in that renders image passes for compositing: an object-ID (clown) pass,
  a depth pass, a raw shadow pass (hard or soft) and an ambient occlusion pass, each aligned
  pixel for pixel with renders of the same view. Merges the earlier ClownID and ZDepth
  plug-ins. Developed with generative AI assistance (Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code,
  Anthropic), directed, reviewed and tested by the author.
keywords:
  - Rhino
  - RhinoCommon
  - clown pass
  - depth map
  - shadow pass
  - ambient occlusion
  - compositing
references:
  - type: software
    title: "Claude (Opus 5.5 version)"
    authors:
      - name: Anthropic
    year: 2026
    url: "https://www.anthropic.com/claude"
    notes: "Large language model; wrote code and documentation for ImgTools."
  - type: software
    title: "Claude Code"
    authors:
